---

<section class="py-20 md:py-24">
  <div class="container-default">
    <p
      class="reveal-tight text-center text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.04em] text-text-tertiary"
    >
      How it works
    </p>
    <h2
      class="reveal mx-auto mt-4 max-w-3xl text-center font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary md:text-4xl"
    >
      What's actually happening
    </h2>
    <p
      class="reveal mx-auto mt-6 max-w-prose text-center text-lg text-text-secondary"
    >
      Ingest splits documents into section-aware chunks, embeds them with
      the provider you chose, indexes them in both a vector store
      (Cloudflare Vectorize or Pinecone) and a BM25 sparse index. Query
      runs both arms in parallel, fuses with reciprocal-rank fusion,
      reranks with Voyage, and synthesizes with the inference model you
      chose. Every step writes an audit row. Every audit row is replayable.
    </p>

    <div
      class="mx-auto mt-12 grid max-w-5xl gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5"
      data-stagger
      data-stagger-step="80"
    >
      {
        [
          { label: 'Ingest', detail: 'section-aware chunks', accent: 'border-accent-teal/50' },
          { label: 'Embed', detail: 'OpenAI / Voyage / Cohere', accent: 'border-accent-teal/50' },
          { label: 'Index', detail: 'Vectorize or Pinecone + FTS5', accent: 'border-accent-amber/50' },
          { label: 'Retrieve', detail: 'dense + sparse, in parallel', accent: 'border-accent-amber/50' },
          { label: 'Fuse · Rerank · Synthesize', detail: 'RRF → Voyage → inference', accent: 'border-accent-magenta/50' },
        ].map((step) => (
          <div
            class={`reveal relative rounded-lg border ${step.accent} bg-bg-elevated p-4`}
          >
            <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.04em] text-text-tertiary">
              {step.label}
            </p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-primary">{step.detail}</p>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <p
      class="reveal mx-auto mt-8 max-w-prose text-center text-sm text-text-tertiary"
    >
      Architecture diagram with the full ingest + query paths is on the
      roadmap. In the meantime: every step above appears in the audit
      object.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
